# --- Unverified likely third-party (Asset Store style) folders ---
# License not individually confirmed - flagged by name/structure
# (readme/documentation files, publisher-style naming, or generic
# "pack"/"freebie" naming) as probable Asset Store content.

# Fantasy knight - full PBR character pack
Assets/Fantasy knight/

# Gumball_Machine - has Documentation/ folder
Assets/Gumball_Machine/

# PanoramicCartoonSkybox - has Readme.pdf
Assets/PanoramicCartoonSkybox/

